    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Doldurma: B\xFCreti standart baz \xE7\xF6zeltisi ile doldurun ve ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7
    seviyesini not edin.Haz\u0131rl\u0131k: Erlenmayerin i\xE7ine asit \xE7\xF6zeltisini
    koyun ve \xFCzerine 2-3 damla indikat\xF6r ekleyin.Titrasyon: B\xFCretin muslu\u011Funu
    yava\u015F\xE7a a\xE7arak baz\u0131n erlenmayer i\xE7ine damlamas\u0131n\u0131
    sa\u011Flay\u0131n. Bu s\u0131rada erlenmayeri s\xFCrekli \xE7alkalay\u0131n.D\xF6n\xFCm
    Noktas\u0131: \xC7\xF6zeltinin rengi kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak de\u011Fi\u015Fti\u011Fi
    an (\xF6rne\u011Fin fenolftalein kullan\u0131l\u0131yorsa pembe oldu\u011Fu an)
    muslu\u011Fu kapat\u0131n.\n\nHesaplama: B\xFCretten harcanan baz miktar\u0131n\u0131
    \xF6l\xE7erek asidin deri\u015Fimini hesaplay\u0131n."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
