  m_text: "B\xFCret: Standart \xE7\xF6zeltinin (baz) damla damla eklenmesini sa\u011Flayan
    dereceli boru.Erlenmayer: \u0130\xE7inde deri\u015Fimi bilinmeyen \xE7\xF6zeltinin
    (asit) bulundu\u011Fu kap.\u0130ndikat\xF6r (\xD6rn: Fenolftalein): pH de\u011Fi\u015Fimine
    g\xF6re renk de\u011Fi\u015Ftirerek deneyin bitti\u011Fini g\xF6steren s\u0131v\u0131.\nB\xFCret
    K\u0131skac\u0131 ve Spor: B\xFCreti dik tutmak i\xE7in kullan\u0131lan d\xFCzenek.Manyetik
    Kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 (Opsiyonel): \xC7\xF6zeltiyi s\xFCrekli
    kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmak i\xE7in."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
